# A polyline's edge typed fast over the canvas, before the field has the
# keyboard: the length 0.4, its second part on the frame the field takes
# the keyboard and Enter on the next; then the angle 90 and Enter on the
# frame after its seed, which places the vertex; Enter again finishes it.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.polyline
wait 2
click L 708 339
move 760 300 3
wait 2
text "0"
wait 1
text ".4"
key Enter
wait 4
text "90"
key Enter
wait 4
key Enter
wait 2
